{"context_through_frame": 156160, "data_kind": "scripted_target_behavior", "example_id": "A001", "messages": [{"audio_id": "U01", "content": "我本来想说“你方便的话，今晚发我就行”，但换成英文写了“Send it tonight.”，回头看感觉像在命令对方。是因为英文更直接吗？", "role": "user"}], "response": {"audio_path": "audio/A001.wav", "audio_sha256": "a70c56d0ed3c022e846507bc88a970024b89da021e614652127a9fd37ddca7cb", "content": "问题通常不在“换成英文”本身，而在你删掉了缓和语。Send it tonight.是直接祈使句；“你方便的话”“就行”原本给了对方选择空间。可改成“If it’s convenient, could you send it tonight?”", "frames": 238080, "role": "assistant", "sample_rate": 16000}, "schema": "duplex_v2.consumed_training_example.v1", "user_id": "U01"}
